#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:5
#: 354d2e0fb29c46bdb99199c14ccf4900
msgid "Magnetic Interference"
msgstr "磁场干扰"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:7
#: 43be1d3d032e41eaaa3176023b0c1013
msgid "This article covers general information related to magnetic interference."
msgstr "本文介绍与磁场干扰相关的常规信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:11
#: b5e61269018648739d07964b76a08429
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:13
#: 056b0f0966dd423a8d822bb768dba0e1
msgid ""
"Magnet Interference on a compass can have a serious impact on navigation "
"on all vehicle types."
msgstr "罗盘上的磁场干扰可对所有飞行器类型的导航产生严重影响。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:16
#: 1d0477a4c5014cc38f4bc320ea7b0848
msgid ""
"This article explains what hardware changes you can make to reduce "
"magnetic interference on the compass, along with supporting theoretical "
"discussion. Information on how to set-up your compass can be found on "
":ref:`Advanced Compass Setup <common-compass-setup-advanced>`."
msgstr ""
"本文说明可以进行哪些硬件改动以减少罗盘上的磁场干扰，并附有相关理论讨论。关于如何设置罗盘，请参见 :ref:`Advanced Compass "
"Setup <common-compass-setup-advanced>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:23
#: 93835c8b00144b2883e0aa23461cbc77
msgid ""
"See also `Magnetic Declination "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Magnetic_declination>`__ (wikipedia)"
msgstr "另见 `磁偏角 <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Magnetic_declination>`__（维基百科）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:27
#: cdbfe5f5e3024598871ad3b4c0a0a275
msgid "Hardware changes to reduce magnetic interference on the compass"
msgstr "减少罗盘磁场干扰的硬件改动"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:29
#: 336c1ade982b4b24b5c66c39c922307f
msgid ""
"The best way method is to use an :ref:`external compass <common-external-"
"magnetometer-for-improved-performance>` or :ref:`GPS+Compass <common-"
"installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module>` module mounted on a mast up and"
" away from magnetic source of interference including the power "
"distribution board (PDB)."
msgstr ""
"最佳方式是使用安装在支架上、远离干扰磁场源（包括分电板 PDB）的 :ref:`外置罗盘 <common-external-"
"magnetometer-for-improved-performance>` 或 :ref:`GPS+罗盘 <common-"
"installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module>` 模块。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:33
#: 63afc193e1144a63bb03aaf427d152ac
msgid ""
"Keep the wires between the PDB, ESCs and battery as short as possible.  "
"The wires from the ESCs to the motors are less important because they are"
" AC and produce less interference."
msgstr "尽量缩短 PDB、ESC 和电池之间的连线。ESC 到电机的连线影响较小，因为它们是交流电，产生的干扰较少。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:36
#: e288bc5b725a41eb8cb7df613deea497
msgid ""
"Twist the wires between the PDB, ESC and battery and use grounded "
"shielding where possible."
msgstr "将 PDB、ESC 和电池之间的连线绞合，并在可能的情况下使用接地屏蔽。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:38
#: e1dcf46501ca472093e67fdb93e51454
msgid ""
"Replace the PDB and ESCs with a 4-in-1 ESC because they tend to produce "
"less interference probably because their wires are shorter and closer "
"together and they also have an aluminum plate on top which may help "
"reduce the interference."
msgstr "将 PDB 和 ESC 替换为四合一 ESC，因为后者产生的干扰通常更少，这可能是因为其连线更短、更集中，而且顶部的铝板也可能有助于减少干扰。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:42
#: c48daf428b3d4e45bd7c20a11197654d
msgid ""
"Add aluminum shielding (even gutter tape) around the wires from the ESC "
"to the motors may reduce the AC interference.  Aluminum will not help "
"reduce the primary DC interference from the PDB, ESCs and the wires "
"connecting them."
msgstr "在 ESC 到电机的连线外加铝屏蔽（甚至排水沟胶带）可能有助于减少交流干扰。铝对 PDB、ESC 及其连线产生的主要直流干扰没有帮助。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:51
#: 24bf5e653b404d74a670fbf149ac6a7a
msgid "Maxwell's Equations - The Magnetic Field on the Axis of a Current Loop"
msgstr "麦克斯韦方程组——电流环轴线上的磁场"

