msgid ""
"Geometric details (from `this web page. <http://hyperphysics.phy-astr. "
"gsu.edu/%E2%80%8Chbase/magnetic/curl oo.html#c2>`__)"
msgstr ""
"几何细节（来自 `此网页 <http://hyperphysics.phy-astr. "
"gsu.edu/%E2%80%8Chbase/magnetic/curl oo.html#c2>`__）"

