#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:78
#: 9da52507d00942b0a41b169c3d65348c
msgid ""
"There are 3 things to get from this drawing and the equation for the "
"magnetic field B as you move away from a current loop along the Z axis:"
msgstr "从该图及沿 Z 轴远离电流环时磁场 B 的方程，可以得出 3 点结论："

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:81
#: d839032395dd415984da01f0e22b97ad
msgid ""
"The magnetic field increases as a function of the enclosed loop area Pi "
"R^2"
msgstr "磁场随封闭回路面积 Pi R^2 的增大而增大"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:84
#: da0e62d5a0ba4c709e4e31490f7e6775
msgid "Big loop = big magnetic field"
msgstr "大回路 = 强磁场"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:85
#: a0140881d0194fd7a248407e85072c74
msgid ""
"Reduce the magnetic field by twisting the loop to close it. aka twist the"
" wires together and keep your return path close to the source"
msgstr "通过绞合回路（即将导线绞合在一起，并使回路与电流源尽量靠近）可以减小磁场"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:88
#: 51622f002336456ba7e570d699ae9d2d
msgid ""
"In the case where you have a PDB and 4 ESCs you have 4 loops that start "
"at the Deans connector on the PDB, go out to the ESC and return back to "
"the Deans connector.  In the case of the 4 in 1 ESC the current flow is "
"much more concentrated in one area and you don't have the big loops so "
"consequently you decrease the magnetic field."
msgstr ""
"在使用 PDB 和 4 个 ESC 的情况下，存在 4 个回路，从 PDB 上的 Deans 接头出发，延伸到 ESC 再返回 Deans "
"接头。对于四合一 ESC，电流更集中在一个区域，不存在大回路，因此磁场更小。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:95
#: 1f1a043b59ea406cb720210a04df3786
msgid "The magnetic field increases as a function of current"
msgstr "磁场随电流的增大而增大"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:97
#: afa68935c5d34023b62052f4ae4a38f8
msgid ""
"Where there is the option, you can deliver the same power and decrease "
"the magnetic field by increasing the voltage and decreasing the current."
msgstr "在可选择的情况下，通过提高电压、降低电流来输送相同功率，可以减小磁场。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:101
#: 8a1804b1e5de454ab8cf69a66947be1f
msgid "The magnetic field decreases as a function of the cube of the distance"
msgstr "磁场随距离的三次方衰减"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:104
#: 10e7cd77312d418db589d183a737d642
msgid ""
"It is more complicated when you are close to the loop but when z >> R the"
" denominator goes to z^3"
msgstr "在靠近回路时情况更为复杂，但当 z >> R 时分母趋近于 z^3。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:107
#: 8ad3a98fa5284bbf9bf7df013064fd9a
msgid ""
"There is one more thing and that is that the direction of the magnetic "
"field depends on the direction that the current flows so when you rotate "
"a battery it changes the magnetic field produced by the current flowing "
"in the battery."
msgstr "还有一点需要注意：磁场方向取决于电流流向，因此旋转电池会改变电池中电流产生的磁场。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:112
#: bb1ec63e3ef44177b742397aac13bff1
msgid ""
"It can't be stated enough that minimizing the enclosed loop areas and "
"moving the compass away from the current will help things work better and"
" \"yes\", power distribution boards with big circular thick high current "
"PC traces on them produce significant semi-spherical fields as large or "
"larger than their diameter."
msgstr ""
"怎么强调都不为过：减小封闭回路面积并将罗盘远离电流，有助于提升性能。「是的」，带有大圆形粗走线高电流 PCB "
"走线的分电板会产生显著的半球形磁场，其范围等于或大于其直径。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:119
#: f9bb0a56c63c4de9ac728024e1235875
msgid "Natural and Artificial Magnetic Anomalies Warning"
msgstr "自然与人工磁场异常警告"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:123
#: 3530e0185312431bbf69a0ac6a89a363
msgid ""
"The following information has not been objectively tested to determine "
"its impact on a vehicle's compass accuracy in flight."
msgstr "以下信息尚未经过客观测试，以确定其对飞行中飞行器罗盘精度的影响。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:126
#: 3a49a6c9ad1a446f9835d3ebcf39ceaf
msgid ""
"Many things can distort the earth's magnetic field in the area you are "
"flying:"
msgstr "许多因素可能会在您飞行的区域扭曲地球磁场："

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:129
#: 7ee43a26e4d946d697a30988770a854d
msgid ""
"Steel framed or reinforced concrete buildings, bridges and roadways, iron"
" pipes and culverts, high power electric lines, heavy equipment, trucks "
"and automobiles, steel tanks, electric motors and even computers."
msgstr "钢框架或钢筋混凝土建筑、桥梁和道路、铁管和涵洞、高压电线、重型设备、卡车和汽车、钢罐、电动机甚至计算机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:133
#: eb7322a84d6e4882a0f8779706bf8e88
msgid ""
"Flying between steel framed or reinforced high rise buildings will "
"distort the magnetic field in addition to causing GPS multi-pathing."
msgstr "在钢框架或钢筋混凝土高楼之间飞行，除了造成 GPS 多路径效应外，还会扭曲磁场。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:137
#: 4d287940ee9943599983fc5f808a224d
msgid "Safe distances for compass calibration"
msgstr "罗盘校准的安全距离"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:139
#: be4df2049d0444e098113de7d6efe975
msgid ""
"6\" (15 cm) minimum: Metal rim glasses, pen/pencil, metal watch band, "
"pocket knife, metal zipper/buttons, belt buckle, batteries, binoculars, "
"cell phone, keys, camera, camcorder, survey nails, metal tape measure."
msgstr ""
"最小 6 英寸（15 "
"厘米）：金属框眼镜、钢笔/铅笔、金属表带、折叠刀、金属拉链/纽扣、皮带扣、电池、望远镜、手机、钥匙、相机、摄像机、测量钉、金属卷尺。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:143
#: fa2fd46888a847c4a746398a3f868719
msgid ""
"18\" (50 cm) minimum: Clipboard, data collector, computer, GPS antenna, "
"2-way radio, hand gun, hatchet, cell phone case with magnetic closure."
msgstr "最小 18 英寸（50 厘米）：写字板、数据采集器、计算机、GPS 天线、对讲机、手枪、小斧、带磁性卡扣的手机壳。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:146
#: b663a96429e74525a4827ef3454ba801
msgid ""
"6 ft (2 m) minimum: Bicycle, fire hydrant, road signs, sewer cap or "
"drain, steel pole, ATV, guy wire, magnets, chain-link fence, bar-wire "
"fence, data collectors"
msgstr "最小 6 英尺（2 米）：自行车、消防栓、路标、下水道盖或排水沟、钢管、ATV、拉线、磁铁、链式围栏、铁丝围栏、数据采集器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:150
#: c787b399aab64830afd39d30b9df66cc
msgid "that use a magnet to hold the stylus."
msgstr "（使用磁铁固定触控笔的数据采集器）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:151
#: 1c290b83788f44e6886fe95159659fd3
msgid ""
"15 ft (5 m) minimum: Electrical box, small car/truck, powerline, building"
" with concrete & steel."
msgstr "最小 15 英尺（5 米）：配电箱、小型轿车/卡车、输电线路、钢筋混凝土建筑。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:153
#: 8aa7f007c81e4d45a19e63c5f7af0809
msgid "30 ft (10 m) minimum: Large truck, metal building, heavy machinery."
msgstr "最小 30 英尺（10 米）：大型卡车、金属建筑、重型机械。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:158
#: ea1911ccccdd47b4aa16a24352827068
msgid "GPS for yaw"
msgstr "GPS 偏航"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:160
#: 663361fc607545f78bca50f09f85a96c
msgid ""
"ArduPilot supports the use of GPS heading information to reduce "
"malfunctions caused by changes in the magnetic field in certain "
"environments."
msgstr "ArduPilot 支持使用 GPS 航向信息，以减少在某些环境下因磁场变化引起的故障。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:162
#: 2b2affb88dee4519a7da599bc5de7d49
msgid ""
"`Configure GPS for yaw <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-gps-for-"
"yaw.html>`__"
msgstr "`配置 GPS 偏航 <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-gps-for-yaw.html>`__"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "On Copter magnetic interference can "
#~ "cause circling (also known as "
#~ "\"toiletbowling\") in Loiter, RTL, AUTO "
#~ "flight modes."
#~ msgstr "在多旋翼上，磁场干扰可能导致在 Loiter、RTL、Auto 飞行模式下出现绕圈飞行（也称为「马桶效应」）。"

